<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summon Earth</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Conjurer (guild level 14)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast summon earth</a>
tell elemental &lt;command&gt;
</pre>
<p>The earth opens, and a small earth elemental (level 17) rises to serve you. 
It follows you, fights beside you when you are in a fight, and when your hit 
points drop below a third it tries to rescue you. You can give it orders with 
tell: to attack (tell elemental kill orc), to walk, and the like. It won't 
attack another player unless both of you have signed the Book of Blood.
</p><p>It doesn't stay long: from half a minute to a minute and a half, longer the 
better your summoning sphere. Then it vanishes in a puff of smoke, dropping 
whatever it carried. If it is killed first, it is gone too.
You can have only one summoned servant at a time: summoning another sends
the first one away.
</p><p>You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
